# @PROJECT_SLUG@

A runnable, headless OOP example. Python 3.12+; application execution uses only
the standard library. The demo account is fictional: `demo` / `demo1234`.

```powershell
python main.py --mock 1 2 3
python main.py --db example.db --register 1 2 3
python main.py --db example.db 4 5 6
```

The memory command returns count 3, total 6 and mean 2. The first SQLite command
registers the account and stores a batch; the next reuses that account and database.
Use a different `--username`/`--password` when registering another account.

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -e '.[dev]'
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -B -m pytest
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -B tools/validate_boundaries.py
.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -B tools/project_admin.py status
```

On POSIX use `.venv/bin/python` for the same Python commands.

`contracts/` defines typed ABCs and frozen data. `src/features/` contains the
existing SQLite auth/data implementations and a batch feature depending only on
their interfaces. `src/container/` injects real or in-memory implementations.
`src/presentation/` only parses and renders one `BatchService.execute` call.
`src/testing/fakes.py` holds relocated headless fakes. Shared auth/data/batch
behavior tests run against both backend combinations; CLI tests prove real usage.
Boundary checks also cover presentation imports.

The backend statistics are retained demo behavior, not a raw-telemetry processor
or a new numerical-validation policy. No Tk, provider or hardware is required.

`config/project.json` has this project's fresh UUID. Project status is
`AWAITING_APPROVAL`; deterministic app/tests run without granting workflow
authority. `tools/project_admin.py review` prepares an offline approval package;
only an explicit owner decision can activate it. No approval, canonical runtime
state, secrets, Git history or paid pilot is copied from the template.

`GENERATION.json` records the source revision, dirty-source flag and exact source/
output hashes. Only the explicit generation manifest is copied. This is one
software worked example; general intake, hardware generation and worker setup
remain separate packages. No workers are launched by generation.
